{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forest 6174</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A BRIEF FIRST-PERSON PSYCHOLOGICAL HORROR EXPERIENCE</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Danny, an exceptional individual. Danny is cooperative. Danny follows the rules. No matter how bad he feels, Danny is always ready to smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, Danny is summoned. Not for a promotion. Not for a reprimand. Just to be given a break, some time out of his routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, Danny is lost in the darkness of the forest, a place where logic crumbles and events defy reality. To find a way out, he must unravel the secret that lies deep within.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162920/extras/039c0fb4b3d47b3a0d69e2eabb5e1183.poster.avif?t=1753794821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162920/extras/039c0fb4b3d47b3a0d69e2eabb5e1183.webm?t=1753794821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162920/extras/039c0fb4b3d47b3a0d69e2eabb5e1183.mp4?t=1753794821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest 6174 offers an immersive first-person experience that combines psychological and atmospheric horror.  The narrative unfolds through subtle interactions with the environment. Explore an eerie location and uncover fragments of the story as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 - 25 minutes of gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment: Each level and the accompanying sounds are part of an immersive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror: The game presents situations in which you do not know if they are real or in your head.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you pay attention you will discover some interesting details.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game has a unique ending.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sad christmas ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3162920/dcf1c42831b637b811211b5a8861561ed79fbea1.jpg"},{"name":"As a child","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3162920/c05e5af7ca732281892ae0d60580f6a94a332fe2.jpg"},{"name":"Where it comes from?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3162920/a798f99b87f4abf5def6b037488f3a1798f145d1.jpg"},{"name":"Red shoes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3162920/e0baf119de57450a093fc7571d0673bb30eb4290.jpg"},{"name":"Testing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3162920/2c57f9e0f32a030d91fec232dcaccb8bdfc083bf.jpg"},{"name":"KAPREKAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3162920/6890c609a4740a06755821d395e6c9abe78fa20b.jpg"},{"name":"It's her","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3162920/86fab1041a3de492411ce011c6cd049c143090e8.jpg"},{"name":"The return","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3162920/336c95a8cdcba32e9560937cdf4d1153c73da697.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3162920?t=1753794821","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162920/b2f1a5aa5514bc5b52724d9db2d1bc1344be9d7d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753794821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162920/241dd73b836023f4516783fefd40686422164a76/capsule_231x87.jpg